1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Before I write, I collect my source notes in one place. This gives me a small starting point.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:40,000
I choose one idea to explain and write a short first draft. I leave the other ideas for another day.

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:01:00,000
I check my draft against the notes before sharing it. A draft stays a draft until I decide it is ready.
